title: "Beyond the Case Count: Mobility, Diet and Mental Health in Bangladesh During COVID-19"
abstract: "A reproducible re-analysis of three open datasets on how COVID-19 affected people in Bangladesh: national policy and mobility series, a two-wave panel of rural women's diets, and an online mental-health survey."
